flowchart LR
    U[Usuario Angular 21] --> L[Login]
    L --> API[NextAudit API / Auth]
    API --> IAM[(PostgreSQL schema iam)]
    IAM --> API
    API --> JWT[JWT access + refresh]
    JWT --> FE[Angular auth state]
    FE --> RG[Angular route guard]
    FE --> API2[Protected API request]
    API2 --> JG[JwtAuthGuard]
    JG --> RBG[RolesGuard / PermissionsGuard]
    RBG --> MOD[Domain module]
    MOD --> DB[(PostgreSQL domain schemas)]
